place. The ","type":"text"},{"code":"location","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" field indicates","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the first vertex you are replacing, with ","type":"text"},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" being the first vertex, ","type":"text"},{"code":"1","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"being the second vertex, and so on. The ","type":"text"},{"code":"length","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" field indicates the number","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of vertices to replace.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"range"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The array of coordinates defining part of the shape. The data in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this array is copied to the shape’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"coordinates","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"coords"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the shape is currently visible on the map as an annotation, it is redrawn"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"immediately. If the shape is part of an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource"},{"type":"text","text":" object, you must"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"explicitly set the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/shape"},{"type":"text","text":" property in order for any style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layers that use the source to be redrawn."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The number of coordinates in "},{"code":"coords","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" must be equal to the length of "},{"code":"range","type":"codeVoice"},